74
00:02:45,856 --> 00:02:46,856
My junior.

75
00:02:46,857 --> 00:02:48,425
- From the clan.
- It's all right.

76
00:02:48,426 --> 00:02:51,296
We came all the way down to Cheonan. Who has ties...

77
00:02:51,326 --> 00:02:52,496
This is my hometown.

78
00:02:52,636 --> 00:02:53,935
- Sun Bin?
- No wonder.

79
00:02:53,936 --> 00:02:55,806
