83
00:03:01,206 --> 00:03:02,505
- No wonder.
- Really?

84
00:03:02,506 --> 00:03:04,005
- I was wondering why we were here.
- Yes.

85
00:03:04,006 --> 00:03:06,015
We're at Cheonan Three-way Intersection Park.

86
00:03:06,016 --> 00:03:07,575
- Yes.
- I have...

87
00:03:07,576 --> 00:03:08,675
a lot of memories about this park.

88
00:03:08,676 --> 00:03:10,415
- It's a beautiful park.
- Around...

89
00:03:10,416 --> 00:03:12,785
Right. The middle school I went to is close to the park.

90
00:03:12,786 --> 00:03:14,286
- I see.
- Yes.

91
00:03:14,756 --> 00:03:16,125
It's nearby.

92
00:03:16,126 --> 00:03:17,126
- I love Cheonan.
- This will be comfortable.

93
