99
00:03:32,236 --> 00:03:35,275
No. The old lady who made the first walnut cakes...

100
00:03:35,276 --> 00:03:36,745
- She was from here.
- Yes.

101
00:03:36,746 --> 00:03:38,205
- That's why.
- The creator was from here.

102
00:03:38,206 --> 00:03:39,346
Right. And Cheonan...

103
00:03:39,816 --> 00:03:41,075
- It's a transport hub.
- Cheonan is...

104
00:03:41,076 --> 00:03:42,115
- a transport hub.
- Right.

105
00:03:42,116 --> 00:03:43,445
- Yes.
- There's so much to see here.

106
00:03:43,446 --> 00:03:44,446
Martyr Yu Gwan Sun.

107
00:03:44,447 --> 00:03:47,085
The Independence Hall of Korea isn't far from the park.

108
00:03:47,086 --> 00:03:49,585
There's a great Byeongcheon sundae restaurant nearby.

109
00:03:49,586 --> 00:03:51,786
- There's a sundae street.
- Byeongcheon sundae.

110
00:03:51,986 --> 00:03:54,595
And pears are famous in Seonghwan which isn't far from here.

111
00:03:54,596 --> 00:03:55,795
