- I barely have any accent. Right?

119
00:04:09,276 --> 00:04:10,906
- Barely.
- Right. Barely.

120
00:04:11,076 --> 00:04:13,216
No, you barely talk like a Seoulite.

121
00:04:13,976 --> 00:04:15,015
Your accent is quite strong.

122
00:04:15,016 --> 00:04:16,085
(It's crystal clear that he's from Busan.)

123
00:04:16,086 --> 00:04:17,086
Right.

124
00:04:17,186 --> 00:04:19,685
