128
00:04:24,826 --> 00:04:26,325
- It will premiere on October 28.
- Yes.

129
00:04:26,326 --> 00:04:28,725
It's called "Ugly Duckling Ms. Maeng."

130
00:04:28,726 --> 00:04:29,995
- "Ugly Duckling Ms. Maeng?"
- It will premiere then.

131
00:04:29,996 --> 00:04:31,065
- Yes.
- "Ugly Duckling Ms. Maeng."

132
00:04:31,066 --> 00:04:32,635
What is it? What kind of movie is it?

133
00:04:32,636 --> 00:04:37,106
The CSAT is considered the Class Two National Secret.

134
00:04:37,236 --> 00:04:39,206
Our movie centers around the people who design questions on the CSAT.

135
00:04:40,736 --> 00:04:42,475
(The test writers from all over the country...)

136
00:04:42,476 --> 00:04:44,206
(have arrived to design questions for the CSAT.)

137
00:04:44,276 --> 00:04:45,576
(Welcome to our facility!)

138
00:04:46,346 --> 00:04:48,815
(A Korean literature teacher, Maeng Bo Ram from a rural city...)

139
00:04:48,816 --> 00:04:52,316
(accidentally becomes a test writer.)

140
00:04:53,616 --> 00:04:55,415
(A veteran test writer, Moon Joo Yeol, )

141
00:04:55,416 --> 00:04:57,356
(chairs the Korean literature committee.)

142
00:04:58,356 --> 00:05:00,195
(They must stay in the dorm for 40 days...)

143
00:05:00,196 --> 00:05:01,426
(with no outside contact.)

144
00:05:02,196 --> 00:05:04,465
(A mission-oriented comedy film with full of chaos...)

145
00:05:04,466 --> 00:05:07,166
(to design questions, free of any problems)

146
00:05:07,836 --> 00:05:10,065
("Ugly Duckling Ms. Maeng," coming soon)

147
00:05:10,066 --> 00:05:12,675
- It's a chaotic black comedy.
- A chaotic black comedy.

148
00:05:12,676 --> 00:05:15,546
Jae Myung. Anyway, you look like a real-life test writer...

149
00:05:15,806 --> 00:05:17,876
- for the CSAT.
- Yes.

150
00:05:18,006 --> 00:05:19,375
- The role perfectly suits him.
- It's your vibe.

151
00:05:19,376 --> 00:05:20,715
- Right. It was perfect for him.
- Actually,

152
00:05:20,716 --> 00:05:22,015
we had to take the old college entrance exam.

153
00:05:22,016 --> 00:05:24,445
- Right.
- I don't know much about the CSAT.

154
00:05:24,446 --> 00:05:25,815
I learned about it through this movie.

155
00:05:25,816 --> 00:05:27,155
- You took the CSAT, right?
- I did.

156
00:05:27,156 --> 00:05:28,215
I also took the CSAT.

157
00:05:28,216 --> 00:05:29,655
- The CSAT.
- Yes.

158
00:05:29,656 --> 00:05:31,885
- Let's stop talking about the CSAT.
- Okay.

159
00:05:31,886 --> 00:05:33,355
We're not here to take the CSAT.

160
00:05:33,356 --> 00:05:34,725
- Right.
- We're in Cheonan too.

161
00:05:34,726 --> 00:05:35,996
- Right.
- Yes.

162
00:05:36,066 --> 00:05:38,936
Students who are studying to take the CSAT this year...

163
00:05:39,096 --> 00:05:40,336
